 "answer": "```cpp\nUVW_INLINE std::string utilities::try_read(int (*read_func)(void *, void *, std::size_t, std::size_t, void *), void *buf, std::size_t suggested, void *arg) noexcept {\n    std::size_t size = suggested;\n    char *data = static_cast<char *>(malloc(size));\n    if (!data) {\n        return \"\";\n    }\n\n    int err = read_func(buf, data, size, suggested, arg);\n    if (err == UV_ENOBUFS) {\n        // Buffer was too small, try again with a larger buffer\n        size = suggested * 2;\n        data = static_cast<char *>(realloc(data, size));\n        if (!data) {\n            free(data);\n            return \"\";\n        }\n\n        err = read_func(buf, data, size, suggested, arg);\n    }\n\n    if (err != 0) {\n        free(data);\n        return \"\";\n    }\n\n    return std::string(data, size);\n}\n```",
